#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:4
msgid "Using Implicit MPM"
msgstr "使用隐式 MPM"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:6
msgid ""
"Newton's implicit Material Point Method (MPM) solver models particle "
"materials such as granular media. MPM support and rigid-MPM coupling are "
"experimental. Start with the compact ``mpm-granular`` example; the "
"``snowball-smash`` and ``teapot-fill`` demos provide polished coupling and "
"cavity-sampling showcases."
msgstr ""
"Newton 的隐式物质点法（MPM）求解器用于模拟颗粒介质等粒子材料。MPM 支持以及刚体-MPM 耦合仍处于实验阶段。建议先运行简洁的 ``mpm-"
"granular`` 示例； ``snowball-smash`` 和 ``teapot-fill`` 演示则更完整地展示了耦合和空腔采样。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:11
msgid ""
"The launcher uses ``cuda:0`` by default. Pass ``--device cuda:N`` to select "
"a different GPU."
msgstr "启动器默认使用 ``cuda:0`` 。传入 ``--device cuda:N`` 可选择其他 GPU。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:16
msgid "Explore MPM Scenes"
msgstr "探索 MPM 场景"

