#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:75
msgid "Train and Regenerate Franka Pour"
msgstr "训练 Franka 倾倒任务并重新生成重置数据"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:77
msgid ""
"The ``IsaacContrib-Franka-Pour`` task restores episodes from a reset "
"artifact containing the connected 14-phase reset distribution. The canonical"
" 20,000-row artifact downloads from the standard Isaac Lab asset root on "
"first use, so training needs no artifact setup:"
msgstr ""
"``IsaacContrib-Franka-Pour`` 任务从重置数据文件恢复回合，该文件包含相互衔接的 14 阶段重置分布。首次使用时，会从标准 "
"Isaac Lab 资产根目录下载含 20,000 行的标准数据文件，因此训练无需另行准备该文件："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:87
msgid ""
"The checked-in generator remains the executable reference for reproducing or"
" customizing the distribution. It takes about two minutes on an L40S-class "
"GPU and writes a local artifact that can be selected explicitly:"
msgstr "仓库中的生成器是复现或自定义该分布的可执行参考。在 L40S 级别的 GPU 上约需两分钟，它会写入一个可显式选择的本地数据文件："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:98
msgid ""
"The task validates the payload's stored content digest automatically. "
"Setting ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` redirects the canonical artifact to a "
"compatible local or self-hosted asset tree. Digest pinning remains available"
" for custom reproducible experiments."
msgstr ""
"任务会自动验证数据中保存的内容摘要。设置 ``ISAACSIM_ASSET_ROOT`` "
"可将标准数据文件的查找位置改为兼容的本地或自托管资产目录树。自定义的可复现实验仍可固定摘要。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:103
msgid ""
"The source uses a non-colliding analytic fill volume whose height is "
"controlled by ``env.source_fill_level`` in ``(0, 1]``. The default ``0.70`` "
"fills roughly 70% of the cup height; the particle count follows the "
"requested fill level while voxel size and particle spacing stay fixed. "
"``env.pour_target_frac`` independently controls the fraction of that live "
"payload that must reach the receiver."
msgstr ""
"源容器使用不参与碰撞的解析填充体积，其高度由 ``env.source_fill_level`` 控制，取值范围为 ``(0, 1]`` 。默认 "
"``0.70`` 表示填充至约 70% 的杯高；粒子数量随指定填充比例变化，而体素大小和粒子间距保持固定。 "
"``env.pour_target_frac`` 独立控制当前粒子总量中必须到达接收容器的比例。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:110
msgid ""
"Play a checkpoint in Kit with the canonical task configuration; no external "
"callback or particle override is required:"
msgstr "使用标准任务配置，在 Kit 中运行检查点；无需外部回调或粒子覆盖配置："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:120
msgid "Minimal Setup"
msgstr "最小配置"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:122
msgid ""
"Use the same voxel size for the solver grid and particle generator. Add the "
"generated object to an :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` like any"
" other declarative asset."
msgstr ""
"求解器网格与粒子生成器应使用相同体素大小。像其他声明式资产一样，将生成的物体添加到 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` 。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:158
msgid ""
"Tune the particle material separately through "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.MPMParticleMaterialCfg`. The implicit solve "
"already resolves collider contact. ``project_outside_colliders`` adds a hard"
" post-step correction for particles that remain inside colliders; use it "
"only when that geometric correction is intentional, and not as a substitute "
"for valid initial states, collision geometry, or a stable timestep. Coupled "
"MPM entries do not support this manager-level projection pass."
msgstr ""
"通过 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.MPMParticleMaterialCfg` "
"单独调整粒子材质。隐式求解本身已经处理碰撞体接触。 ``project_outside_colliders`` "
"会在步进后对仍位于碰撞体内部的粒子执行硬性修正；仅在确实需要该几何修正时使用，不应以它替代有效初始状态、碰撞几何或稳定的时间步长。耦合 MPM "
"条目不支持这一管理器级投影步骤。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:166
msgid ""
"Both :class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.MPMGridCfg` and "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.MPMPointsCfg` author schema-valid "
"``UsdGeom.Points`` simulation geometry. Grid configurations still generate "
"the lattice in Isaac Lab before authoring explicit points, widths, "
"velocities, and masses. Materials use ``NewtonMPMMaterialAPI``; damping [s] "
"is authored as ``damping * young_modulus`` [Pa·s]. ``critical_fraction`` "
"remains solver-global on :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MPMSolverCfg` and "
"is authored on the owning ``NewtonMPMSceneAPI`` physics scene."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.MPMGridCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.MPMPointsCfg` 都会编写符合模式的 ``UsdGeom.Points`` "
"仿真几何。网格配置仍先在 Isaac Lab 中生成点阵，再写入显式点、宽度、速度和质量。材质使用 ``NewtonMPMMaterialAPI`` "
"；阻尼 [s] 以 ``damping * young_modulus`` [Pa·s] 写入。 ``critical_fraction`` 仍是 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MPMSolverCfg` 上的求解器全局参数，写入所属的 "
"``NewtonMPMSceneAPI`` 物理场景。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:175
msgid ""
"Grid jitter is generated once in asset-local coordinates with a fixed seed, "
"so USD clones share the same local particle distribution. Use reset events "
"or domain randomization when each environment needs an independent "
"distribution."
msgstr ""
"网格扰动使用固定种子，在资产局部坐标系中只生成一次，因此 USD 克隆共享相同的局部粒子分布。如果各环境需要独立分布，请使用重置事件或域随机化。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:180
msgid ""
"Controlled material experiments, comparison demos, and practical solver "
"advice are collected in :ref:`newton-tuning-mpm`."
msgstr "受控材质实验、对比演示和实用求解器建议见 :ref:`newton-tuning-mpm` 。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:185
msgid "Render a Particle Surface"
msgstr "渲染粒子表面"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:187
msgid ""
"MPM simulation state remains a set of particles. Surface reconstruction is "
"an optional visualization pass: it does not change particle motion, "
"collisions, or material behavior. Run the teapot demo to compare the "
"available modes:"
msgstr "MPM 仿真状态始终是一组粒子。表面重建是可选的可视化步骤，不会改变粒子运动、碰撞或材质行为。运行茶壶演示可对比可用模式："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:203
msgid ""
"The teapot demo defaults to the reconstructed surface. Select ``particles`` "
"or ``both`` to inspect the source MPM state in Newton GL or Newton RTX."
msgstr ""
"茶壶演示默认显示重建表面。选择 ``particles`` 或 ``both`` ，可在 Newton GL 或 Newton RTX 中查看原始 "
"MPM 状态。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:206
msgid ""
"Surface rendering is available in the Newton GL and Newton RTX visualizers. "
"The Kit visualizer continues to render the MPM particles directly."
msgstr "Newton GL 和 Newton RTX 可视化器支持表面渲染，Kit 可视化器仍直接渲染 MPM 粒子。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:215
msgid ""
"This recording demonstrates rendering appearance, not a different "
"constitutive model."
msgstr "这段录制展示的是渲染外观，并非另一种本构模型。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:218
msgid ""
"The teapot demo configures ``newton.geometry.ParticleSurface`` after "
"``sim.reset()`` and updates the mesh before ``sim.render()``. Its renderer "
"captures extraction on CUDA when enabled and stages the dynamic mesh inside "
"the viewer's frame lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"茶壶演示在 ``sim.reset()`` 后配置 ``newton.geometry.ParticleSurface`` ，并在 "
"``sim.render()`` 前更新网格。启用 CUDA 捕获时，其渲染器会捕获表面提取操作，并在查看器的帧生命周期内暂存动态网格。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:223
msgid "Tune reconstruction independently from the simulation:"
msgstr "重建参数应独立于仿真调节："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:225
msgid ""
"``voxel_size`` controls surface detail and memory use. It can be smaller "
"than the MPM solver voxel size."
msgstr "``voxel_size`` 控制表面细节和内存用量，可以小于 MPM 求解器的体素大小。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:227
msgid ""
"``kernel_radius`` controls how far each particle contributes to the surface."
" Start near three times the particle spacing."
msgstr "``kernel_radius`` 控制每个粒子对表面的影响范围。建议从粒子间距的三倍左右开始。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:229
msgid ""
"``max_grid_cells`` provides fixed-capacity storage for CUDA graph capture. "
"Increase it if the reconstructed domain outgrows the reserved grid."
msgstr "``max_grid_cells`` 为 CUDA 图捕获提供固定容量的存储。如果重建区域超出预留网格，请增大该值。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:231
msgid ""
"Anisotropic kernels preserve sheets and stretched fluid features better, but"
" cost more than isotropic kernels."
msgstr "各向异性核能更好地保留薄片和拉长的流体特征，但开销高于各向同性核。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:234
msgid ""
"The teapot demo handles CUDA graph capture, empty surfaces, inactive "
"particles, and dynamic topology:"
msgstr "茶壶演示处理了 CUDA 图捕获、空表面、未激活粒子和动态拓扑："

